"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["problems."]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 101, "parameters": ["Original Player Face", 6, 0, 2]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["Why are you doing this? You "]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["seemed...\\.nicer than most of the monsters "]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["I've met."]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 101, "parameters": ["MGFaceset15", 4, 0, 2]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["What can I say, I've got a good "]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["influence. But I don't like people "]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["disrespecting my work. "]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 101, "parameters": ["MGFaceset15", 4, 0, 2]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["Do you know how long I was in that cave, "]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["coming up with riddles while I waited for "]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["someone to try and take the staff? And "]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["you just waltz in and beat me up!"]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 101, "parameters": ["Original Player Face", 4, 0, 2]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["Sorry..."]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 101, "parameters": ["MGFaceset15", 4, 0, 2]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["I gave you the benefit of the doubt and "]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["let you take it. And then we met again! "]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["And you just threw my riddle in my face "]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["again!"]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 101, "parameters": ["Original Player Face", 4, 0, 2]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["We were in a hurry! "]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 101, "parameters": ["MGFaceset15", 4, 0, 2]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["Well now you're not going anywhere."]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["And it's too late for apologies. You're "]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 