code": 212, "parameters": [-1, 117, false]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 230, "parameters": [4]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 231, "parameters": [1, "Werecat1644", 0, 0, 0, 0, 100, 100, 255, 0]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 322, "parameters": [1, "Were Cat Sprite Set", 1, "Brown Catgirl Face", 0]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 101, "parameters": ["Brown Catgirl Face", 3, 0, 2]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["Ngh, couldn't even let me keep my "]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["dick..."]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 101, "parameters": ["MGFaceset15", 4, 0, 2]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["Sorry, but no. Sphinxes are a cross "]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["between a lion and a woman. Not a "]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["man."]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 235, "parameters": [1]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 213, "parameters": [-1, 3, false]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 101, "parameters": ["Brown Catgirl Face", 2, 0, 2]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["Actually that is only true for the greek "]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["sphinx. The egyptian sphinx was a cross "]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["between a man and lion. The whole riddle"]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["thing is also a greek thing."]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 101, "parameters": ["MGFaceset15", 4, 0, 2]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["More of that brain you should have used. "]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["Guess what? I don't care. I like making "]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["riddles. Any more \"Sphinx Facts\" you'd "]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["like to tell me? \\}Before it's too late..."]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 231, "parameters": [1, "Werecat2172", 0, 0, 0, 0, 100, 100, 255, 0]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 101, "parameters": ["Brown Catgirl Face", 2, 0, 2]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["The \"Riddle of the Sphinx\" comes from "]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["the sphinx that-\\.oh, yay. I've got tits "]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["now.-\\.guarded the greek city of Thebes. "]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["Theebes? Thebees? Something like that."]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 101, "parameters": ["MGFaceset15", 4, 0, 2]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["Fascinating...go on. \\}*giggle*"]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 235, "parameters": [1]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 213, "parameters": [-1, 2, false]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 101, "parameters": ["Brown Catgirl Face", 2, 0, 2]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["Once she was beaten she killed herself? "]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["Um...I think. She jumped to her death? "]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["Or maybe she ate herself. I dunno."]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 101, "parameters": ["MGFaceset15", 4, 0, 2]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["You doing okay there? You look like "]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["you're having a little trouble."]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 212, "parameters": [-1, 117, false]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 230, "parameters": [4]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 231, "parameters": [1, "Werecat2166", 0, 0, 0, 0, 100, 100, 255, 0]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 322, "parameters": [1, "Were Cat Sprite Set", 3, "Blonde Catgirl Face", 0]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 101, "parameters": ["Blonde Catgirl Face", 2, 0, 2]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["Um, yeah. It's just a bit hard to "]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["remember with my body changing and "]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["whatever. I mean, I've got boobies now! "]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["That's weird, right?"]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 101, "parameters": ["MGFaceset15", 4, 0, 2]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["Is it? Seems pretty normal to me."]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["You're a sphinx. All sphinxes are "]}, {"indent": 