ose riddles "]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["right."]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 101, "parameters": ["MGFaceset15", 4, 0, 2]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["Oh yes. That's why you'll need to think "]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["up some really hard riddles."]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 212, "parameters": [-1, 117, false]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 230, "parameters": [4]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 231, "parameters": [1, "Sphinx251", 0, 0, 0, 0, 100, 100, 255, 0]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 322, "parameters": [1, "Were Cat Sprite Set", 6, "Blonde Catgirl Face", 0]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 213, "parameters": [-1, 1, false]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 101, "parameters": ["Blonde Catgirl Face", 4, 0, 2]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["Yeah! I like, totally don't want anyone "]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["getting in! Sphinxes are supposed to "]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["like, protect pyramids right? You can "]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["count on me!"]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 101, "parameters": ["MGFaceset15", 4, 0, 2]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["I sure can, my dear sister. Why don't "]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["you go and protect the entrance. If any "]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["intruders get past you, I'll give them "]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["my riddle."]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 101, "parameters": ["Blonde Catgirl Face", 4, 0, 2]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["Great idea sis! You're like, so smart!"]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 221, "parameters": []}, {"indent": 0, "code": 101, "parameters": ["", 0, 1, 2]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["You take your job, like, totally seriously. After "]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["all, your big sister gave it to you, so it must "]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["be super important!"]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 231, "paramet